00:26:26.190 --> 00:26:28.440
What people have seen is
that variable block size

00:26:28.440 --> 00:26:30.150
works better because
in some cases,

00:26:30.150 --> 00:26:33.498
if the area is not
as much textured, you

00:26:33.498 --> 00:26:35.790
can have a much bigger block
size, while in some cases,

00:26:35.790 --> 00:26:40.480
you can have a much
smaller block size, so on.

00:26:40.480 --> 00:26:42.910
So, yeah.

00:26:42.910 --> 00:26:46.300
So again, as you can see, we
can see these motion vectors

00:26:46.300 --> 00:26:47.110
in this case.

