There's one P-frame here,
there's one P-frame here.

00:40:03.370 --> 00:40:04.090
Yeah, sorry.

00:40:10.380 --> 00:40:12.720
OK, let me see.

00:40:12.720 --> 00:40:13.920
Where are the frames?

00:40:13.920 --> 00:40:16.830
So we can also look at this
