00:40:16.830 --> 00:40:21.480
here to know what is happening.

00:40:21.480 --> 00:40:23.430
So this is an I-frame.

00:40:23.430 --> 00:40:26.250
This is an I-frame.

00:40:26.250 --> 00:40:32.010
And what are we predicting?

00:40:32.010 --> 00:40:34.680
So this is a P-frame,
this is a B-frame.

00:40:44.270 --> 00:40:48.740
Yes, I think it's encoding.

00:40:48.740 --> 00:40:51.290
If you look at this curve,
then this is a P-frame,

00:40:51.290 --> 00:40:53.495
this is also a P-frame,
